{"id":2228,"date":"2024-09-19T12:31:47","date_gmt":"2024-09-19T12:31:47","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/?post_type=product&#038;p=2228"},"modified":"2025-10-02T15:26:17","modified_gmt":"2025-10-02T15:26:17","slug":"double-wall-cardboard-boxes","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/double-wall-cardboard-boxes\/","title":{"rendered":"Double Wall Cardboard Boxes"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2 data-start=\"94\" data-end=\"134\">Durable Double Wall Cardboard Boxes<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"74\" data-end=\"428\">Double wall cardboard boxes are an ideal choice when strength and protection matter most. At <a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/\"><em data-start=\"167\" data-end=\"189\">Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/em><\/a>, we offer custom double-wall-cardboard-boxes at wholesale prices, built from high-grade corrugated material. These boxes are engineered to support heavy products, resist crushing, and provide enhanced durability during transit or storage.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"430\" data-end=\"709\">Our boxes are suitable for various industries including manufacturing, electronics, homeware, food distribution, and retail shipping. Whether you&#8217;re shipping bulk items or need added protection for delicate equipment, our double wall boxes help reduce the risk of product damage.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"980\">We also offer free design and shipping, custom sizes, and a wide range of printing options. You can request gloss, matte, or Spot UV coatings to make your packaging meet your branding requirements. Turnaround is fast. Quality is consistent. Support is always available.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"982\" data-end=\"985\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"987\" data-end=\"1028\">Why Choose Double Wall Cardboard Boxes<\/h2>\n<h3 data-start=\"1030\" data-end=\"1068\">Built with Strength and Durability<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"1070\" data-end=\"1248\">Double wall cardboard boxes consist of two layers of corrugated fluting between three paper liners. This added thickness provides greater resistance to compression and punctures.<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1391\">\n<li data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1281\">\n<p data-start=\"1252\" data-end=\"1281\">Ideal for stacking on pallets<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1315\">\n<p data-start=\"1284\" data-end=\"1315\">Reduces product movement inside<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1316\" data-end=\"1346\">\n<p data-start=\"1318\" data-end=\"1346\">Handles heavier loads safely<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1347\" data-end=\"1391\">\n<p data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1391\">Minimizes damage in long-distance shipping<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"1393\" data-end=\"1476\">They\u2019re a reliable packaging solution when product protection is your top priority.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1518\">Available in Custom Sizes and Styles<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"1520\" data-end=\"1616\">We offer full customization for businesses that require precise dimensions or unique box styles.<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"1618\" data-end=\"1756\">\n<li data-start=\"1618\" data-end=\"1645\">\n<p data-start=\"1620\" data-end=\"1645\">Custom die-cuts available<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1646\" data-end=\"1680\">\n<p data-start=\"1648\" data-end=\"1680\">Print your logo and brand colors<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1681\" data-end=\"1712\">\n<p data-start=\"1683\" data-end=\"1712\">Request inserts or partitions<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1713\" data-end=\"1756\">\n<p data-start=\"1715\" data-end=\"1756\">Wide range of sizes for all product types<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"1758\" data-end=\"1864\">Each box is designed for optimal use of space, helping you cut shipping costs while maximizing protection.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"1866\" data-end=\"1869\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"1871\" data-end=\"1919\">Corrugated Cardboard Boxes for Heavy-Duty Use<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"1921\" data-end=\"2151\">Double wall boxes fall under the category of <a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/corrugated-cardboard-boxes\/\"><strong data-start=\"1966\" data-end=\"1996\">Corrugated Cardboard Boxes<\/strong><\/a>, specifically designed for high-performance packaging needs. These boxes are tested under pressure and meet quality standards for strength and durability.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"2153\" data-end=\"2192\">Double Wall Boxes Wholesale Options<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"2194\" data-end=\"2335\">If you\u2019re sourcing large quantities, our <strong data-start=\"2235\" data-end=\"2266\">Double Wall boxes wholesale<\/strong> rates provide cost-effective solutions without compromising quality.<\/p>\n<ol data-start=\"2337\" data-end=\"2485\">\n<li data-start=\"2337\" data-end=\"2375\">\n<p data-start=\"2340\" data-end=\"2375\">Bulk pricing options for businesses<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2376\" data-end=\"2410\">\n<p data-start=\"2379\" data-end=\"2410\">Discounts on high-volume orders<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2411\" data-end=\"2447\">\n<p data-start=\"2414\" data-end=\"2447\">Low minimums for small businesses<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2448\" data-end=\"2485\">\n<p data-start=\"2451\" data-end=\"2485\">Consistent supply for repeat needs<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p data-start=\"2487\" data-end=\"2598\">This makes it easier for growing businesses to access strong packaging materials without stretching the budget.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"2600\" data-end=\"2643\">Double Wall Cardboard Boxes options<\/h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>Specification<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Details<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Material Options<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Finishing Choices<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Add-ons &amp; Features<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Usage\/Application<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Product Name<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Double Wall Cardboard Boxes<\/td>\n<td>Corrugated Board (BC Flute, EB Flute, EE Flute)<\/td>\n<td>Gloss, Matte, Spot UV, Varnish<\/td>\n<td>Reinforced Edges, Divider Inserts<\/td>\n<td>Heavy-duty shipping, Industrial packaging<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Supplier<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/td>\n<td>Recycled Kraft, White SBS, Brown Kraft<\/td>\n<td>Anti-scratch, Soft Touch<\/td>\n<td>Custom Logo Printing, Barcodes, QR Codes<\/td>\n<td>E-commerce packaging, Storage<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Pricing<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Wholesale pricing with bulk discounts<\/td>\n<td>Tiered pricing for large orders<\/td>\n<td>Flexible MOQ<\/td>\n<td>Subscription &amp; Auto-restock<\/td>\n<td>Warehousing, Retail packaging<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Material Strength<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Two layers of corrugated fluting for extra durability<\/td>\n<td>FSC-certified board<\/td>\n<td>Food-safe coating available<\/td>\n<td>Impact &amp; Crush Resistant<\/td>\n<td>Fragile product shipping, Electronics<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Box Styles<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Regular Slotted Container (RSC), Die-cut, Tuck-end<\/td>\n<td>Custom sizes<\/td>\n<td>Lamination, Foil Stamping<\/td>\n<td>Handles, Tear Strips, Perforations<\/td>\n<td>Moving boxes, Pallet shipping<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Printing Options<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Full-color CMYK, PMS matching<\/td>\n<td>Offset &amp; Digital Printing<\/td>\n<td>Inside &amp; Outside Printing<\/td>\n<td>Logo Branding, Instruction Graphics<\/td>\n<td>Branding &amp; Marketing Packaging<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Durability<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Strong load-bearing capacity<\/td>\n<td>Double-wall fluting<\/td>\n<td>Weather-resistant coating<\/td>\n<td>Stacking &amp; Long-term storage<\/td>\n<td>Furniture, Heavy goods, Bulk items<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Eco-Friendly Options<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Available on request<\/td>\n<td>Recycled &amp; Compostable Cardboard<\/td>\n<td>Soy-based inks<\/td>\n<td>Biodegradable adhesive<\/td>\n<td>Sustainable shipping solutions<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Customization<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Full customization in size, thickness, &amp; printing<\/td>\n<td>Small to Extra-large dimensions<\/td>\n<td>Flexible design options<\/td>\n<td>Die-cut windows, Compartments<\/td>\n<td>Tailored industrial packaging<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Minimum Order Quantity<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Starting from 100 units<\/td>\n<td>Scalable to 500,000+<\/td>\n<td>Bulk order discounts<\/td>\n<td>OEM branding available<\/td>\n<td>Businesses of all sizes<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Shipping<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Free nationwide shipping<\/td>\n<td>Global export available<\/td>\n<td>Flat-packed for storage<\/td>\n<td>Quick assembly<\/td>\n<td>Retail, E-commerce, B2B shipping<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Turnaround Time<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Standard 7\u201310 business days<\/td>\n<td>Rush orders on request<\/td>\n<td>Fast bulk production<\/td>\n<td>Reorder flexibility<\/td>\n<td>Seasonal campaigns, Urgent deliveries<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<h2 data-start=\"3320\" data-end=\"3358\">Material Quality and Design Options<\/h2>\n<h3 data-start=\"3360\" data-end=\"3390\">Strong Corrugated Material<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"3392\" data-end=\"3541\">Double wall boxes are made using two corrugated inner layers and three outer liners. This structure makes them more resilient than single wall boxes.<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"3543\" data-end=\"3664\">\n<li data-start=\"3543\" data-end=\"3592\">\n<p data-start=\"3545\" data-end=\"3592\">Flute types: B-flute, C-flute or BC-combination<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3593\" data-end=\"3634\">\n<p data-start=\"3595\" data-end=\"3634\">Available in white or brown kraft paper<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3635\" data-end=\"3664\">\n<p data-start=\"3637\" data-end=\"3664\">Eco-friendly and recyclable<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"3666\" data-end=\"3707\">Finishing Choices and Coating Options<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"3709\" data-end=\"3795\">We provide premium finishing options to make your boxes ready for shipping or display.<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"3797\" data-end=\"3913\">\n<li data-start=\"3797\" data-end=\"3829\">\n<p data-start=\"3799\" data-end=\"3829\">Gloss coating for a shiny look<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3830\" data-end=\"3863\">\n<p data-start=\"3832\" data-end=\"3863\">Matte coating for a smooth feel<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3864\" data-end=\"3913\">\n<p data-start=\"3866\" data-end=\"3913\">Spot UV for specific logo or graphic highlights<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"3915\" data-end=\"4012\">You can add tear-strips, locking tabs, or printed handling instructions as per your requirements.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"4014\" data-end=\"4017\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"186\" data-end=\"234\"><strong data-start=\"186\" data-end=\"232\">How to Choose the Right Box for Your Needs<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4053\" data-end=\"4307\">If you are exploring packaging options by durability levels, visit our <a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product-category\/Cardboard-Boxes-by-Material-Strength\/\"><strong data-start=\"4124\" data-end=\"4164\">Cardboard Boxes by Material Strength<\/strong><\/a> category. You\u2019ll find a wide range of packaging boxes categorized by strength level including single wall, double wall, and triple wall boxes.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4309\" data-end=\"4416\">This helps businesses select boxes based on the weight and sensitivity of their products without confusion.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"4418\" data-end=\"4421\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"4423\" data-end=\"4457\">Multiple Uses Across Industries<\/h2>\n<h3 data-start=\"4459\" data-end=\"4481\">Ideal Applications<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"4483\" data-end=\"4532\">Double wall cardboard boxes are commonly used in:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"4534\" data-end=\"4712\">\n<li data-start=\"4534\" data-end=\"4569\">\n<p data-start=\"4536\" data-end=\"4569\"><strong data-start=\"4536\" data-end=\"4550\">Automotive<\/strong> parts distribution<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4570\" data-end=\"4617\">\n<p data-start=\"4572\" data-end=\"4617\"><strong data-start=\"4572\" data-end=\"4586\">E-commerce<\/strong> for fragile and heavy products<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4618\" data-end=\"4655\">\n<p data-start=\"4620\" data-end=\"4655\"><strong data-start=\"4620\" data-end=\"4636\">Food service<\/strong> for bulk transport<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4656\" data-end=\"4712\">\n<p data-start=\"4658\" data-end=\"4712\"><strong data-start=\"4658\" data-end=\"4678\">Industrial goods<\/strong> that require protective packaging<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"4714\" data-end=\"4732\">Usage Benefits<\/h3>\n<ul data-start=\"4734\" data-end=\"4844\">\n<li data-start=\"4734\" data-end=\"4766\">\n<p data-start=\"4736\" data-end=\"4766\">Minimize returns due to damage<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4767\" data-end=\"4797\">\n<p data-start=\"4769\" data-end=\"4797\">Improve product presentation<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4798\" data-end=\"4844\">\n<p data-start=\"4800\" data-end=\"4844\">Ensure customer satisfaction during delivery<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<hr data-start=\"4846\" data-end=\"4849\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"4851\" data-end=\"4884\">Printing and Branding Services<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4886\" data-end=\"4937\">Make your packaging speak for your brand. We offer:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"4939\" data-end=\"5081\">\n<li data-start=\"4939\" data-end=\"4984\">\n<p data-start=\"4941\" data-end=\"4984\">High-resolution digital and offset printing<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4985\" data-end=\"5013\">\n<p data-start=\"4987\" data-end=\"5013\">CMYK and PMS color options<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"5014\" data-end=\"5038\">\n<p data-start=\"5016\" data-end=\"5038\">Custom artwork support<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"5039\" data-end=\"5081\">\n<p data-start=\"5041\" data-end=\"5081\">Branded inserts and printed instructions<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"5083\" data-end=\"5172\">This helps businesses build identity and improve unboxing experience for their customers.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"5174\" data-end=\"5177\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"5179\" data-end=\"5212\">Order Now with Fast Turnaround<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"5214\" data-end=\"5322\">At Shop Cardboard Boxes, we make it easy to place bulk orders and receive high-quality packaging with speed.<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"5324\" data-end=\"5458\">\n<li data-start=\"5324\" data-end=\"5364\">\n<p data-start=\"5326\" data-end=\"5364\">Free design and shipping across the US<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"5365\" data-end=\"5406\">\n<p data-start=\"5367\" data-end=\"5406\">Quick production and delivery timelines<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"5407\" data-end=\"5458\">\n<p data-start=\"5409\" data-end=\"5458\">Support for both small and large-scale businesses<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"5460\" data-end=\"5560\">Choose from gloss, matte, or Spot UV finishes and enjoy full control over size, style, and printing.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"5562\" data-end=\"5565\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"5567\" data-end=\"5600\">Explore More Packaging Options<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"5602\" data-end=\"5864\">Looking for boxes with added visibility or display value? We also offer <a class=\"cursor-pointer\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"5674\" data-end=\"5776\"><strong data-start=\"5675\" data-end=\"5706\">Cardboard Boxes With Window<\/strong><\/a> that let your customers peek inside the product while still providing secure packaging.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5866\" data-end=\"5943\">These are helpful for bakery items, gifts, apparel, and promotional products.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Double Wall Cardboard Boxes are sturdy and reliable for shipping and storage. They are made from high-quality corrugated cardboard that provides excellent protection for your products. Protect your products with durable and affordable Double Wall Cardboard Boxes from Shop Cardboard Boxes. Order now and take advantage of our free design and shipping services.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":2301,"template":"","meta":{"_joinchat":[]},"product_brand":[],"product_cat":[180],"product_tag":[],"class_list":["post-2228","product","type-product","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","product_cat-cardboard-boxes-by-material-strength","rishi-post","first","instock","shipping-taxable","purchasable","product-type-simple"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v27.9 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Get Double Wall Cardboard Boxes And Packaging<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Strong and sturdy double wall cardboard boxes, perfect for moving, e-commerce, and industrial applications. Order now and enjoy fast shipping.\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/double-wall-cardboard-boxes\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Get Double Wall Cardboard Boxes And Packaging\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Strong and sturdy double wall cardboard boxes, perfect for moving, e-commerce, and industrial applications. Order now and enjoy fast shipping.\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/double-wall-cardboard-boxes\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Shop Cardboard Boxes\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2025-10-02T15:26:17+00:00\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/Double-Wall-Cardboard-Boxes-1.jpg\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"1200\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image\/jpeg\" \/>\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" c